WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:09.400
<b>Monday</b>

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.400
Hey, hey! Did you watch it?

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.150
Trending Topics
1. IZUMI
2. SHOUGO
3. Ryouma
4. Debut
5. Press Conference
6. Sena Family
7. CRUSHERZ

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.910
I did!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.140
You're talking about the 
debut conference, right?

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.740
Shougo's little brother!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.990
I can't believe he's a boy!

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<b>Sena Celebrity Family</b>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.240
Izumi's Striking Debut

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<b>He's Actually <b>Male</b>! 
Shougo's Younger 
Brother Debuts!</b>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.120
He's just so cute! Oh, Izumi!

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.750
We managed to pull it off.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.580
Even two days later, every publication 
is running the Izumi story.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.590
Ryouma's scandal has completely vanished.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.170
They not only got our participation 
for Izumi's debut,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.840
they've put us in their debt, huh?

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.470
Works for me.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:47.860
<b><i>Ichijou Ryouma's Lover? 
The Truth Revealed!!</i></b>

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>And that's because he's...</i>

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.860
<i>...a boy!</i>

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.820
They really did save our asses.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>Good work, everyone—WISH!</i>

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.900
More importantly...

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.280
Shougo from CRUSHERZ?!<i></i>

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.530
<i>This is my little brother Izumi, and 
he's making his show business debut!</i>

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.410
<i>Everyone, please welcome him!</i>

00:02:54.150 --> 00:03:01.530
Sena Family's Younger Son
IZUMI (18) Debuts!

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:58.190
<i>So what we originally thought would be a marriage 
announcement for Ichijou Ryouma-san</i>

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.530
<i>turned out to be the debut announcement 
of his supposed bride-to-be, Izumi-san!</i>

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.490
<i>Everyone assumed he was a girl,</i>

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.200
<i>but he actually turned out to be a boy!</i>

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.290
<i>I was completely fooled!</i>

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.710
<i>But he's amazingly cute, isn't he? </i>

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.580
<i>Wearing a dress,</i>

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.670
<i>he really doesn't look 
remotely male, does he?</i>

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.130
<i>Absolutely! It's just unfair, isn't it?</i>

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.250
Izumi...

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:21.930
<i>His father is famed singer and Kohaku 
Utagassen veteran, Sena Seiya-san.</i>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.720
<i>His mother is a major film 
actress, Sena Nagisa-san.</i>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.100
<i>And his older brother is Shougo, 
the vocalist of the band CRUSHERZ.</i>

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.470
<i>Everywhere you turn, people 
are talking about Izumi.</i>

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.640
<i>Sagara-san's plan certainly succeeded...</i>

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.940
<i>Wow, what an impressive family!</i>

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.770
<i>It's a rare event, the birth of 
a star with an immense pedigree!</i>

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.270
<i>What do you think about it, Yamada-san?</i>

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.360
<i>Well, all sorts of things get said 
about second-generation stars.</i>

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.360
<i>But I think...</i>

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.910
<i>what a cutie!</i>

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:45.870
<i>Tell ya what, Izumi's my type!</i>

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.660
<i>He really is a beauty, isn't he?</i>

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.330
<i>I'm jealous!</i>

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.700
<i>I wanna eat him right up.</i>

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.830
<i>What? Izumi-kun's a boy, you know!</i>

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.580
<i>I-I see...</i>

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.790
<i> Izumi's debut in show biz means</i>

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:01.050
<i>now the whole world will know how cute he is.</i>

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.590
<b>The world will discover my Izumi...</b>

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.590
Which means...

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.640
<i>Boy, girl, it doesn't mean a thing!</i>

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:05.890
<i>Cuteness justifies all!</i>

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.720
<i>Izumi-kun, let's have 
dinner together some time!</i>

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.850
<i>...the entire world is now my rival!</i>

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.150
<b><i>Which Way Is Right?</i></b>

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:18.320
Yes. Then, please send 
the proposal over to us.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.820
Hello, Sena Productions.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.150
Yes, this is the contact address for Izumi. 

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.530
We look forward to working with you.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.200
I'm afraid Izumi's schedule 
is still currently unconfirmed. 

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.200
Goodbye.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.240
<i>All according to plan!</i>

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.790
<i>Just listen to those phones ring!</i>

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:35.870
<i>They've been ringing off the hook 
non-stop since the press conference!</i>

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.840
<i>Though, our real problem starts now.</i>

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.840
<i>What kind of performance can the talentless
Izumi possibly do?</i>

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.380
<i>If possible, I'd like to 
start him on something simple</i>

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.260
<i>and ease him into the business.</i>

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.100
Yes, thank you very much.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.060
Goodbye.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.980
<i>A package from Amazones for Sena Izumi-san!</i>

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.730
<i>This is the umpteenth delivery 
for him this morning!</i>

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.400
<i>He's been holed up in his room</i>

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.570
<i>ever since we returned from the conference.</i>

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.030
<i>What on Earth is he doing now?</i>

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.740
<i>I'm getting suspicious... 
Let's have a look at this, shall we?</i>

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.330
Th-This is...

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:22.670
Buy... {Note: He's on an online auction site and is placing bids and also using the "buy it now" option to buy stuff.}

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:24.630
Place bid...

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.380
Buy...

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.050
What?! There's only a used 
copy available of this one?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.260
There's no helping it...

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.560
Place bid...

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:35.980
No! Someone else bid right 
before the auction ended?!

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.600
Izumi-san, I've got a package for you.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.150
Thanks. I'm in the middle 
of something right now,

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.440
Confirm Bid

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:42.440
so can you leave it out there?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.570
I knew it.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.610
Wait a—Rei! What do you think you're doing?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.700
Nothing but Ichijou Ryouma merchandise.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.160
<b>AAAAAAAHHH!!!</b>

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:54.240
I-It's not what you think!

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:56.660
This is all just for reference—or, 
for my own research!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.750
So don't get the wrong idea!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.750
Do you like Ryouma?

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.380
I-I don't like him.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.920
Oh-ho?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.010
Then what's that?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:11.300
<b>Limited-Edition Commemorative T-Shirt for Ryouma's Debut Event—5000 Yen...</b>

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:11.720
This?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.220
Th-this was just an honest mistake!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.680
I-I put it on without realizing what it was!

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:17.770
Oh?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.100
Seems pretty clear to me...

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.020
Wh-what are you trying to say?

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.480
Nothing at all.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.980
I won't butt in where it's not necessary.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:25.900
But...

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.990
I will say one thing.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.160
I wouldn't be opposed to you 
being with Ichijou Ryouma.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.620
But why? We'd be a guy-guy couple.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.290
I believe...

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.330
...Ryouma is a good man.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:45.380
I-I could see that without you telling me.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:43.960
POUT

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.420
Oh, is that so?

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:51.090
<i>Though the biggest reason is that Ryouma 
is show biz's current heartthrob.</i>

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:53.050
I do know that...

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.890
<i>But I can't just...</i>

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:01.100
<i>...embrace my feelings 
for him just like that...</i>

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.940
<i>I mean... I </i>am<i> a boy, after all...</i>

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.530
Well, this isn't something 
you need to rush into.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:15.450
I think this is already a good deal of 
progress for a virgin otaku like you.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.740
Rei, did you casually say 
something really mean just now?

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.580
That reminds me, Izumi-san!

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.460
How long do you intend 
to stay shut up in here?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.840
I got out-bid on my auction!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.340
<b>Filming in Progress</b>

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.340
It was him! He's the culprit!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.550
Shit!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.260
Tanaka, radio the station!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:32.430
Right!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.430
This feels like deja vu...

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:39.140
Cut! Cut!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.730
Ichijou-san, are you all right?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.520
I-I'm sorry...

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.060
Let's take a short break.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.150
Take five, people!

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.490
I saw your press conference, Ryouma-san!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:52.150
I'd love to meet Izumi!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.820
Would you introduce us?

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.280
He's just so adorable!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.950
I want to meet him, too!

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:58.870
Me, too! Me, too!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.140
Me three!

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.790
Uh, sure, if a chance comes up...

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:06.710
<i>I knew it! Everyone's after Izumi now.</i>

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.000
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.050
<i>At this rate, someone could 
steal him away from me...</i>

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.380
<i>No...</i>

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.010
<i>I can't call it "stealing,"</i>

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:17.010
<i>since there's still nothing 
between Izumi and me.</i>

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:17.930
<i>Now that I think about it</i>,

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.520
<i>we haven't progressed at all out 
of the "comfortable friends" zone.</i>

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.390
<i>In fact...</i>

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.150
You're just like my big brother!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.320
<i>In any case, I'll just not 
introduce him to anyone!</i>

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.030
Good morning!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:32.400
We're from Sena Productions.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.570
We've brought our new talent 
today to greet you all.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:35.610
Pardon the intrusion!

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.080
Izumi!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.540
Ryouma!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.540
<i>Why is he here?!</i>

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.410
Rei said I should go around 
introducing myself as a newcomer.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.380
We've made the rounds at a few production 
studios and TV stations already.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.000
I-I see...

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:50.050
What are you doing here, Ryouma?

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:51.210
I'm filming my drama—

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.760
Speak of the devil!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.880
It's really him! Izumi-kun!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:55.880
Hi, there!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.180
<i>You scum...</i>

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.060
It's really Izumi-kun, in the flesh!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.310
You're so cute!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.680
And so small!

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:04.310
Ryouma-kun, introduce us already!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.100
Yes, do!

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:05.980
Please?

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.310
Right now!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.820
Um... this is Izumi.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:12.940
I-I'm Izumi. It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.320
He's so cute!

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:15.900
And so beautiful!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.410
May I ask how old you are?

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.280
I-I'm eighteen.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.330
You're kidding! You look way younger!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.910
I watched your debut conference.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:23.620
Oh...

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.040
I'm a huge fan of your brother!

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:25.710
Thank you.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.330
I once acted in a film with 
your mother, long ago.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.380
Can I get a photo with you?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.340
I want one, too!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:32.670
I'll be next after you, two.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.090
All right!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.170
Your skin is so supple!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:37.510
That's sexual harassment.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.760
Then I'll let him touch me, too.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.390
Hey—Ryouma?!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.140
Aww, they left!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.520
'Cuz you made him uncomfortable, 
touching him like that!

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:50.400
Aww...

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.360
I didn't get my photo with him yet!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.650
Neither did I!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.400
Hey! Ryouma!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:56.650
What's the matter?

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:58.530
Talk to me!

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.870
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.880
Wh-What?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.090
What's wrong, Ryouma?

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:14.370
Why...

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:18.720
Why do you have to smile 
like that at those people?

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.470
Huh?

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.060
Rei told me it was important to 
smile nicely when I greeted people.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.890
Then why did you let them 
paw you all over like that?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.640
Let them paw me?

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.100
What are you trying to say?

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.360
Damn.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.360
I was right to be worried.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.730
If it's already like this when 
you're just starting out...

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:36.740
Ryouma...

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.360
Seriously, what's wrong?

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:45.580
How do you feel about me?

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:46.790
Huh?!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.790
R-Ryouma?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.870
Do you like me even a little?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.170
Or am I still just a texting buddy?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.630
W-Well, I...

00:10:59.030 --> 00:10:59.720
That hurts!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:00.590
Hey, what—

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:01.840
I'm afraid.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.100
Huh?

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.890
I'm afraid of you becoming famous

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.180
and getting tons of admirers.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.900
I'm afraid someone's going to steal you...

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.810
away from me!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.230
Ryouma...

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.030
That's why I...

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:24.070
I want something solid...

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:25.700
between us...

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:27.990
<b>My BL radar 
is going off!!</b>

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.000
Ah! Ah!

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>Squee!</b>

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.710
That's why I...

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.460
I want something solid...

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:38.090
between us...

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.010
Huh?

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.050
Ryouma?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.810
<b>Room Reserved for Actors</b>

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.810
<b>Kaneki Kenji 
Ichijou Ryouma-sama</b>

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:45.550
You're burning up!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:46.810
S-Someone!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.060
Someone, help!

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:48.890
Rei!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.730
Rei!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.190
It was a sudden fever brought on by overwork.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:12:00.900
I did think he seemed a bit 
off during filming today.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.200
We'll keep him in the hospital and 
monitor his condition for a few days.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:07.280
I apologize for all the 
trouble we've caused you.

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:09.370
Not at all. We pray for his swift recovery.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.200
We'll take our leave now.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.370
Let's go, Izumi-san.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.300
His schedule was already very full,

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.090
and we went and squeezed that 
debut conference in as well.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.930
I should make an apology 
to Ryuuzaki-san as well.

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:32.480
<i>Ryouma...</i>

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.980
<i>There was so much pain in his face.</i>

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.060
<i>Was it because of the fever?</i>

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.940
<i>Or...?</i>

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:47.490
He's coming home from the hospital today?

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.490
I'm very glad to hear it.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.330
Yes, you have a good one too.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.300
<i>I have deliveries for Sena 
Izumi-san from Amazones,</i>

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:09.220
<i>Rakutenten Books, Animite, and Kuma no Ana!</i>

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:13.850
<i>He's locked himself in his room and 
gone on another online shopping spree</i>

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.640
<i>since we got home from the hospital.</i>

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.850
<i>What could it be this time?</i>

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.980
Izumi-san! More packages for you!

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:25.110
No answer.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:25.990
That settles it.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.490
I'll just have to kick down the door again.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:29.910
Rei...

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.080
What's happened to you, Izumi-san?

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.450
A-Are you not feeling well?

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:37.370
Just a little sleep-deprived.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.460
Never mind that.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.340
Your timing is perfect.

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.050
There's something I want to ask you.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.090
Come in.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:45.380
Okay...

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.840
Pardon the intru—

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.680
W-what is this mountain of manga?!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.180
It's BL manga!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.310
BL?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.390
Love stories between guys!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.440
Huh?! Why do you have 
so much of such a thing?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.690
I thought I should do 
some proactive research.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:08.200
But while I was reading, a point 
came up that's been bothering me.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.610
Right...

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:16.000
Okay, if it's something I can answer, I will.

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:17.750
So...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:18.960
Yes?

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.460
Does it hurt when two guys 
have sex? Or does it not?!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.920
'Cuz look! In this manga, it seems to hurt!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:29.380
<b>Totally
 Serious</b>

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:27.840
But in this one, he says,

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:31.390
"Even though it's my first 
time, it feels so good!"

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.390
That's <i>what's bothering you?</i>

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.390
<b>Sir, your muscles 
are so tight!</b>

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.390
<b>It's my first time, 
but it feels so good!</b>

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:32.930
Which one is right?!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.640
<b>Completely, 
Utterly Serious</b>

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.140
Come on, tell me!

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:39.140
<i>I don't know if he's being 
proactive or just an idiot...</i>

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:40.810
Well, then...

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.650
I'll answer you seriously.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.610
It depends on the person.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.190
The person?

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:47.820
Yes.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.820
Depending on your partner's 
knowledge, experience, age,

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.410
and size, it can vary.

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.410
For instance, if your partner 
is young and inexperienced,

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.830
<b>Don't worry about a
 thing! Just trust me!</b>

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.830
<b>You better not let go!</b>

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.830
there is a high chance it will hurt for you.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.250
I see!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.420
Then...

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.790
Then, um, can I ask your opinion?

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:04.710
Yes.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:09.170
How... do you think Ryouma would be?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.340
Oh god, I said it!

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.260
Well...

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:17.600
<i>I want to tell him it'll be fine, but...</i>

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:20.270
<i>He doesn't seem to have 
prior experience with men,</i>

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.560
<i>and he's already maxed out 
on holding himself back...</i>

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.020
It may...

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.190
...hurt a little.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.280
No!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:30.740
I knew it, I can't do this!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.610
I'm scared to do it with a guy!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.740
<i>And, back to square one.</i>

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:37.080
<i>He can't do anything but 
go around in circles...</i>

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.160
<i>What a hopeless boy...</i>

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.120
Ah, yes! I have some good news.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:46.250
Ryouma was finally able to leave 
the hospital today, it seems.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:50.130
He apparently canceled his substantial 
schedule for the day and is resting at home.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:51.840
I see.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.680
I'm going out for a bit.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.060
Izumi-san.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.110
Here.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.030
The good luck charm...

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.490
You should return it to him personally.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.740
Thank you, Rei.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.240
Okay, I'm heading out to 
meet the Manga Club guys

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:22.660
so we can make our Summer 
Doujinshi Festival plans!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.130
Huh?!

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:26.960
W-wait a minute,

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.300
you're not going to 
Ryouma's to see how he is?

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:29.880
Huh?

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:33.380
But I can't miss the Summer 
Festival. After all...

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.430
...we even got ourselves a 
table! So I have to go.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.310
Well, see you later!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.640
<i>Is he really that stupid?!</i>

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.730
Also... I can't go see Ryouma just yet.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.150
Izumi-san...

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.730
Then, please do take care out there.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.990
Remember, your face is 
known to the public now.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:53.900
I know.

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:56.700
But I'll have my glasses on, 
so no one should recognize me.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>Well, well. I suppose I needn't have worried.</i>

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:02.660
<i>He's thinking things through on his own.</i>

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:06.370
<i>Though, since he's an idiot, 
he'll take the long way around.</i>

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.080
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.590
<i> I can't go see Ryouma yet.</i>

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.550
<i>Not until I make a final decision 
on how I feel about him.</i>

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.430
<i>But...</i>

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.260
<i>...I don't think I can put off 
deciding for much longer.</i>

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.640
<i>Otherwise...</i>

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.770
Do you like me even a little?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.020
Or am I still just a texting buddy?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.020
I want something solid...

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.440
between us...

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.120
<i>Should I say yes?</i>

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.160
<i>Or no?</i>

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.160
<i>I need to decide once and for all.</i>

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:52.500
It's great donating blood 
in the summer, huh? {Note: Sorry, I was reading "Kaneda" as "Kinta" before}

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.960
It's nice and cool in there, 
and we can sit and read manga!

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.340
It's the best!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.760
Well, it's certainly not bad.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:04.020
How do you read your name again?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.770
<b>Kaneda        Kurimu</b>

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.770
It's "Kurimu".

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:12.730
<b>Kurimu</b>

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.690
...You've had a hard life.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.650
What?

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:12.730
Just what are you trying 
to say, Futoyama-kun?

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:15.440
Give it back!

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.530
Well, guess I've got no choice 
but to hang out with you.

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.740
You're kinda rude, dude...

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.700
Yo, Kuroi!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.450
Huh? Why are you coming from that way?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.330
I thought you lived in 
the opposite direction.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:31.000
Oh... I was at my part-time job.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.920
What have you two been up to?

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.630
Ta-dah!

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.170
Donating blood, huh?

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.380
You too, Futoyama?

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:38.800
Yeah, maybe...

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.590
Futoyama-kun, show him your card too!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:42.300
Nah, there's nothing to see.

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:42.800
<b>Futoyama Zenon</b>

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:46.850
<b>Zenon</b>

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:43.350
What are you getting shy about?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.720
That doesn't suit your character!

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.850
<b>Zenon?</b>

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.350
Just forget it!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.850
<b>Bingo!</b>

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.140
Let's see...

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.980
Where were we supposed to meet...

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.440
I'm sorry! Are you all right?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.690
<b>Oh . . .</b>

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:00.030
What do I do now?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.410
I'm so sorry!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.950
What should I do?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:04.910
Huh?

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.580
You're Izumi!!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:08.200
What was that?

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:09.330
Did she say Izumi?

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:09.830
Where?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.330
Isn't that him? From the 
"Happy Wedding" commercial?

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:12.830
I knew it!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:14.540
I watched your debut conference!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.840
Oh, wow, you're so cute!

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.050
Just adorable!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.720
Please, will you shake my hand?

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.430
<i>Oh, no. At this rate...</i>

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.430
"Izumi?" You mean <i>that</i> Izumi?!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:20.880
It's true!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.140
You're kidding!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.680
<i>I need to escape!</i>

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:23.140
From the press conference?

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.100
He's running away!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:25.970
Wait!

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:27.270
Please, a handshake!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.020
Izumi!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.020
Here we are!

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.230
Looks like Sena's not here yet.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.110
Tardiness is the worst of all human traits.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.200
He's still got three minutes.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:46.160
<b>No purchased merchandise may be traded, bought, or sold in the vicinity of this store!</b>

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.990
A proper member of society 
arrives five minutes early.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:45.240
Then we're late, too.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.160
Wait!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.040
Izumi!

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:48.450
There he is!

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.580
Izumi! Please give me your autograph!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:50.500
Where is he?

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:51.040
There he goes!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.120
Izumi!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:52.870
There he is!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.000
Wait!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.130
I'll go check it out.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:58.960
What's going on over there?

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.260
Who knows.

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:01.970
Where did he go?

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:02.930
He's gone!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:11.350
<b>NO ENTRY</b>

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:04.340
Vanished!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.890
That's odd...

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.180
Who were they chasing anyway?

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.600
Someone famous?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.350
I wanted to get a photo...

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.690
Oh, well. Let's get going!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:19.070
I escaped somehow...

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.200
But mob mentality sure is scary!

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.820
Thank goodness this door was unlocked...

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:30.700
Though, I'm probably not 
allowed to be back here.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:33.870
I'm making Kuroi-kun and 
the others wait too...

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.670
I wonder if there's another exit somewhere...

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.130
Hey!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:40.880
We're in the middle of a transaction here!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:41.760
Get lost!

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:46.640
I'm very sorry... I just got a little lost...

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:51.930
<i>Out of the frying pan and into the fire!</i>

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.270
I-I'm so sorry! I'll leave right now!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:58.310
H-Hey! This kid was just on TV!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.820
On TV? Is he an actor or something?

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.570
I'm pretty sure he's the younger 
brother of Shougo from CRUSHERZ.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.110
Little brother?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.910
Don't ya mean little sister?

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:10.030
Huh?

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:11.830
I'm pretty sure they said "brother."

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:12.750
Hey, stop!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.710
Leave us yer money!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.790
Leave it!

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.500
Forget that guy.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.170
We've got something way more 
interesting over here...

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:25.840
Sena,

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:27.590
where are you?

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.800
Shougo's little brother, huh?

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.270
But you sure do got a pretty face...

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:36.640
Let's take a look and see whether 
you're really a boy or a girl...

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.480
That's a great idea!

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:41.650
Then we'll know if it's a little 
brother or little sister for sure!

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.360
C'mon...

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:46.200
Let's play nice together...

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.370
Stop—

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:21.790
It was my first love.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:23.080
Th-That seems ominous...

00:23:23.400 --> 00:23:24.340
That's a relief!

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:25.670
Come over tonight.

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:27.760
I have faith that we'll 
meet again one day-lulu!

00:23:28.060 --> 00:23:29.340
He's our son, after all.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:31.510
I wasn't going to tell you, but...

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:34.680
<b><i>Love Isn't Enough</i></b>

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:34.220
Love isn't enough!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>My friends from
 the Manga Club
 at my college!</b>
